OL,3,ABadenoch urges PM to overturn ban on
OL,4,Anew licences as gas drilling gets
OL,5,Ago-ahead at Jackdaw
OL,6,
OL,7,FKemi Badenoch calls on Andy Burnham to
OL,8,Foverturn Labour's ban on new oil and
OL,9,Fgas licences, following the decision to
OL,10,Fallow gas drilling at Jackdaw
OL,12,FIn the Commons earlier, the
OL,13,FConservative leader said the UK can't
OL,14,Fbe a "serious player on the world
OL,15,Fstage" if ministers "dither" for years
OL,16,Fover "approving a single licence"
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
