OL,3,AMacron accuses foreign leaders of
OL,4,Aexploiting French riots
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking on a visit to the Middle East,
OL,7,Fhe referred to them as "leaders who are
OL,8,Fin campaign mode, whether here in the
OL,9,Fregion or on the other side of the
OL,10,FAtlantic".
OL,12,FIt was an apparent swipe at Israeli
OL,13,FPrime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu, who
OL,14,Ffaces parliamentary elections next
OL,15,Fweek, and US President Donald Trump,
OL,16,Ffor whom mid-term polls fall next
OL,17,Fmonth.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
